/// Frozen render fingerprints for `RasterGoldenHarness`.
///
/// Generated by `CaptureCat --raster-golden --refreeze` at the commit that removed
/// the last `import SwiftUI`, from renderers that had just passed the live
/// SwiftUI-vs-CoreGraphics diff under a 1.0/255 mean bar.
///
/// Each value is a 12x7 grid of mean straight-RGBA cells, hex-encoded — see
/// `RasterFingerprint`. `blobCounts` is the structural companion: a downsample
/// cannot see a duplicated Dynamic Island, a connected-component count can.
///
/// These say "this still renders what it rendered when it was proved correct".
/// They cannot re-derive correctness, so DO NOT refreeze to make a red gate
/// green — read the printed per-cell deltas and the `-cg.png` output first, and
/// only refreeze when the render change is one you meant to make.
